                    <note type="editorial">  There are several entries before 1795, and then nothing until 1824 - and on that occasion Godwin bestows both consonants on the end of Crosdill's name!  
  Many of the connections are to <persName key="HOL01">Holcroft</persName> and/or to <persName key="SHI01">Shield</persName>.
</note>
